{"seq":1,"slug":"customs-status-buyer-communication","title":"清关状态与买家主动沟通","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/landed-cost-ddp-buyer-experience/ddp-experience-ops/customs-status-buyer-communication","wordCount":2410,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"清关状态与买家主动沟通\">清关状态与买家主动沟通</h1><p>跨境订单的物流页上有一段特殊的静默：包裹显示「已到达目的地口岸」之后，可能连续三到五天没有任何更新。承运商事件停在那里，海关系统内部在流转，平台侧拿不到任何新信息。买家每天刷新几次，从焦虑到怀疑再到投诉。这段静默期是跨境客服工单最集中的来源之一，而它偏偏发生在平台<strong>确实没有新信息</strong>的时候。这一篇处理的正是这个矛盾：在信息真空期，如何用已知的确定性替代未知的不确定性，让买家不被丢在黑暗里。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>外部状态码要归一化成六个买家可理解阶段</strong>：已离开发货地、已到达口岸、清关处理中、海关查验中、税费处理中、已放行派送中。</li>\n<li><strong>「税费处理中」在 DDP 下对买家不可见</strong>：DDP 的承诺就是让买家与缴税无关，暴露内部缴税流程只会制造「是不是要我付钱」的误解；DAP 下则必须可见且附金额。</li>\n<li><strong>外部码到阶段的映射要按承运商与口岸配置，并容忍未知码</strong>，未登记的码不丢弃、映射到安全默认阶段并报警。</li>\n<li><strong>推送的判断标准是「是否改变买家要做的事或对时间线的预期」</strong>，同阶段重复事件与内部处理事件都不推送。</li>\n<li><strong>清关 ETA 是随机变量</strong>，应给基于历史分位的区间与参照系措辞，而不是精确到日的承诺。</li>\n<li><strong>事件处理三条规则</strong>：按业务时间而非接收时间排序、幂等去重、状态不回退。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"清关状态的归一化\">清关状态的归一化</h2><p>第一个前提是：不同承运商与清关代理返回的状态码互不相同，且粒度差异极大——有的只给「清关中」，有的给二十几个细分状态。买家可理解的阶段则少得多。因此需要一层归一化，把外部状态映射到固定的买家可见阶段。这种碎片化并非电商特有的问题：WCO 关于跨境电子商务的框架标准（2018 年 6 月通过，含 15 条全球标准）把「提前电子数据与风险管理」列为首要原则，并与 UPU 联合推出海关与邮政间的电子报文以实现邮件的事前通知与可能的事前放行（<a href=\"https://www.wcoomd.org/en/topics/facilitation/activities-and-programmes/ecommerce.aspx\">WCO: Cross-Border E-Commerce</a>）——标准化是行业层面的方向，而平台侧的归一化层正是这条方向在自家数据上的落地。</p>\n<h3 id=\"六个买家可理解的阶段\">六个买家可理解的阶段</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>买家可见阶段</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>典型时长</th>\n<th>DDP 下是否对买家可见</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>已离开发货地</td>\n<td>出口清关完成、干线运输中</td>\n<td>数天</td>\n<td>可见</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>已到达目的地口岸</td>\n<td>货物抵达进口国，等待申报</td>\n<td>数小时至两天</td>\n<td>可见</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>清关处理中</td>\n<td>申报已提交，等待海关审结</td>\n<td>一天至数天</td>\n<td>可见</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>海关查验中</td>\n<td>被抽中查验或申报被质疑</td>\n<td>两天至两周</td>\n<td>可见（但需谨慎措辞）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>税费处理中</td>\n<td>涉及应缴税费的确认与缴纳</td>\n<td>DDP 下买家不可见</td>\n<td>仅内部可见</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>已放行派送中</td>\n<td>清关完成，进入末端网络</td>\n<td>一至数天</td>\n<td>可见</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>表中最后一行前的那一项是全篇的关键：<strong>在 DDP 模式下，「税费处理中」这个阶段不应当对买家可见</strong>。因为 DDP 的承诺正是让买家与缴税这件事无关；把内部缴税流程暴露给买家，只会制造「是不是要我付钱」的误解。这是 DDP 与 DAP 在状态展示策略上最本质的区别——DAP 下这一阶段必须可见且要附带金额，否则买家会在收货时被到付账单突袭。</p>\n<h3 id=\"映射表要可配置\">映射表要可配置</h3><p>归一化映射必须按承运商与口岸维护，且要能容忍未知状态码。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;normalizer_version&quot;: &quot;2026.09&quot;,&#10;  &quot;carrier&quot;: &quot;global_express&quot;,&#10;  &quot;mappings&quot;: [&#10;    { &quot;carrier_code&quot;: &quot;RE&quot;, &quot;buyer_stage&quot;: &quot;arrived_at_port&quot;, &quot;internal_only&quot;: false },&#10;    { &quot;carrier_code&quot;: &quot;CU&quot;, &quot;buyer_stage&quot;: &quot;customs_in_progress&quot;, &quot;internal_only&quot;: false },&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;carrier_code&quot;: &quot;DI&quot;,&#10;      &quot;buyer_stage&quot;: &quot;duty_processing&quot;,&#10;      &quot;internal_only&quot;: true,&#10;      &quot;applies_when&quot;: { &quot;incoterm_mode&quot;: &quot;DDP&quot; }&#10;    },&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;carrier_code&quot;: &quot;DI&quot;,&#10;      &quot;buyer_stage&quot;: &quot;duty_processing&quot;,&#10;      &quot;internal_only&quot;: false,&#10;      &quot;buyer_notice&quot;: { &quot;template&quot;: &quot;duty_due_notice&quot;, &quot;requires_amount&quot;: true },&#10;      &quot;applies_when&quot;: { &quot;incoterm_mode&quot;: &quot;DAP&quot; }&#10;    },&#10;    { &quot;carrier_code&quot;: &quot;EX&quot;, &quot;buyer_stage&quot;: &quot;released_in_transit&quot;, &quot;internal_only&quot;: false }&#10;  ],&#10;  &quot;unknown_code_policy&quot;: { &quot;buyer_stage&quot;: &quot;customs_in_progress&quot;, &quot;alert&quot;: &quot;data_quality&quot; }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"normalizer_version\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026.09\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"carrier\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"global_express\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"mappings\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"carrier_code\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"RE\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"buyer_stage\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"arrived_at_port\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"internal_only\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"carrier_code\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"CU\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"buyer_stage\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"customs_in_progress\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"internal_only\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"carrier_code\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"DI\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"buyer_stage\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"duty_processing\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"internal_only\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"applies_when\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"incoterm_mode\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"DDP\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"carrier_code\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"DI\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"buyer_stage\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"duty_processing\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"internal_only\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"buyer_notice\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"template\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"duty_due_notice\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"requires_amount\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"applies_when\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"incoterm_mode\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"DAP\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"carrier_code\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"EX\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"buyer_stage\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"released_in_transit\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"internal_only\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"unknown_code_policy\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"buyer_stage\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"customs_in_progress\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"alert\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"data_quality\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>applies_when</code> 让同一个外部状态码在不同交货模式下映射到不同可见性——这是 DDP/DAP 双模式并存时最容易写错的地方。<code>unknown_code_policy</code> 则是容错底线：遇到未登记的码不要丢弃事件，映射到一个安全的默认阶段并报警。</p>\n<h2 id=\"什么时候该主动推送\">什么时候该主动推送</h2><p>主动沟通的价值不是「发得多」，而是「在该说话的时候说话，在不该说话的时候不制造噪音」。过度推送会让买家对通知脱敏，关键时刻的通知反而被忽略。</p>\n<h3 id=\"应当推送的四个时点\">应当推送的四个时点</h3><p><strong>阶段跃迁时</strong>：从「已到达口岸」到「清关处理中」是一个有意义的变化，值得一次通知。但同一阶段内的重复事件不推送。</p>\n<p><strong>静默超阈值时</strong>：若「清关处理中」持续超过该口岸该通道的历史 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>75</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{75}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">75</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 时长，主动告知买家「正在处理，预计还需 X 天」。这一条是覆盖静默期的核心手段——不发新信息，但发出「我们知道你在等」。</p>\n<p><strong>需要买家动作时</strong>：DAP 下需要缴税、或收件信息不完整需要补充。此时沉默的代价最高。</p>\n<p><strong>异常出现时</strong>：查验、退运、需要补充单证。</p>\n<h3 id=\"不应当推送的情况\">不应当推送的情况</h3><p>同一阶段内的重复扫描、非工作时间的事件、以及内部处理类事件（如税费已由平台垫付）都不推送。判断标准是：<strong>这条信息是否改变买家需要做的任何事或对时间线的预期</strong>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[承运商事件到达] --&gt; B[归一化为买家阶段]&#10;  B --&gt; C{阶段是否跃迁}&#10;  C --&gt;|是| D{是否内部阶段}&#10;  D --&gt;|是 如DDP缴税| E[仅内部记录 不推送]&#10;  D --&gt;|否| F[推送阶段通知]&#10;  C --&gt;|否| G{静默是否超阈值}&#10;  G --&gt;|是| H[推送进度安抚 无新事实]&#10;  G --&gt;|否| I{是否需要买家动作}&#10;  I --&gt;|是| J[推送动作请求]&#10;  I --&gt;|否| K[不推送 仅落库]\">graph TD\n  A[承运商事件到达] --&gt; B[归一化为买家阶段]\n  B --&gt; C{阶段是否跃迁}\n  C --&gt;|是| D{是否内部阶段}\n  D --&gt;|是 如DDP缴税| E[仅内部记录 不推送]\n  D --&gt;|否| F[推送阶段通知]\n  C --&gt;|否| G{静默是否超阈值}\n  G --&gt;|是| H[推送进度安抚 无新事实]\n  G --&gt;|否| I{是否需要买家动作}\n  I --&gt;|是| J[推送动作请求]\n  I --&gt;|否| K[不推送 仅落库]</pre><h2 id=\"预计到达时间的表达\">预计到达时间的表达</h2><p>清关阶段的 ETA 与运输阶段的性质不同：运输阶段可以由承运商里程与航班推算，清关阶段的时长由海关工作量、查验概率与单证质量决定，本质上是随机变量。给一个精确到日的 ETA 会持续失信。</p>\n<h3 id=\"用区间与口径替代点估计\">用区间与口径替代点估计</h3><p>可行做法是给出<strong>基于本口岸本通道历史分布的区间</strong>，并明确它是统计口径而非承诺：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>D</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">[</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>0.25</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>D</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>p</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>l</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>0.75</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>D</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>p</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>l</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"true\">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[\\hat{D}] = \\left[Q_{0.25}(D \\mid p, l),\\ Q_{0.75}(D \\mid p, l)\\right]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1968em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1944em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0.25</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0.75</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">]</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 是口岸，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>l</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">l</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span> 是贸易通道（如空运个人物品、空运商业快件）。分母不对时不要外推——样本不足的口岸应当回退到更粗的分组或明确告知「暂无历史数据」。</p>\n<h3 id=\"措辞比数字更重要\">措辞比数字更重要</h3><p>同样的区间，两种说法体验差别很大。「预计还需 2–4 天」隐含承诺；「该口岸近期平均 3 天放行，你的包裹已处理 1 天」给出的是参照系而非承诺。后者在超时后不会转化为欺骗感。这与 <a href=\"../landed-cost-estimation/front-estimate-confidence-badge\">前台预估精度与可信度展示</a> 中「区间与承诺必须在视觉上分离」是同一个原则，只是对象从金额换成了时间。</p>\n<h2 id=\"数据质量的自我保护\">数据质量的自我保护</h2><p>清关状态链路上最大的工程风险不是推送策略，而是<strong>事件本身不可信</strong>。承运商可能重复推送同一事件、可能乱序推送、可能长时间不推送后又补一批带历史时间戳的事件。</p>\n<h3 id=\"三条处理规则\">三条处理规则</h3><p><strong>按业务时间而非接收时间排序</strong>：补推的事件携带原始发生时间，必须按它排序，否则时间线会倒退。</p>\n<p><strong>幂等去重</strong>：同一（承运商，事件码，发生时间，地点）组合视为同一事件，重复到达不产生新的阶段跃迁，也不触发二次推送。</p>\n<p><strong>状态不回退</strong>：归一化后的买家阶段只允许向前推进，除非收到明确的「查验」或「退运」这类降级信号。未经解释的回退会让买家看到包裹「倒退」的荒谬体验。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 幂等落库与阶段跃迁判定&#10;INSERT INTO clearance_event (order_id, carrier_code, event_code, occurred_at, location, raw_ref)&#10;VALUES ($1, $2, $3, $4, $5, $6)&#10;ON CONFLICT (order_id, carrier_code, event_code, occurred_at, location) DO NOTHING;&#10;&#10;-- 只在阶段前进时写买家阶段并排队通知&#10;WITH ranked AS (&#10;  SELECT ne.event_id, ne.order_id, nm.buyer_stage, nm.stage_rank, nm.internal_only&#10;  FROM clearance_event ne&#10;  JOIN normalizer_map nm ON nm.carrier_code = ne.carrier_code AND nm.event_code = ne.event_code&#10;  WHERE ne.order_id = $1 AND ne.id &gt; $2&#10;  ORDER BY ne.occurred_at DESC&#10;  LIMIT 1&#10;)&#10;UPDATE order_clearance_state s&#10;SET buyer_stage = r.buyer_stage, stage_rank = r.stage_rank, updated_at = now()&#10;FROM ranked r&#10;WHERE s.order_id = r.order_id&#10;  AND r.stage_rank &gt; s.stage_rank&#10;RETURNING s.order_id, s.buyer_stage, r.internal_only;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 幂等落库与阶段跃迁判定</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INSERT INTO</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> clearance_event (order_id, carrier_code, event_code, occurred_at, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">location</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, raw_ref)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VALUES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ($</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">6</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> CONFLICT (order_id, carrier_code, event_code, occurred_at, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">location</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) DO NOTHING;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 只在阶段前进时写买家阶段并排队通知</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ranked </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> ne</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">event_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">ne</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">order_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">nm</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">buyer_stage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">nm</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">stage_rank</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">nm</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">internal_only</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> clearance_event ne</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> normalizer_map nm </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> nm</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">carrier_code</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> ne</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">carrier_code</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> nm</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">event_code</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> ne</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">event_code</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> ne</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">order_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> ne</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> ne</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">occurred_at</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DESC</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  LIMIT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">UPDATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> order_clearance_state s</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SET</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> buyer_stage </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">buyer_stage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, stage_rank </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">stage_rank</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, updated_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ranked r</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">order_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">order_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">stage_rank</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">stage_rank</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">RETURNING </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">order_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">buyer_stage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">internal_only</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>第二条语句的 <code>RETURNING</code> 直接给出了「是否需要通知」的判据：有返回行说明发生了阶段前进，<code>internal_only</code> 为真则只落库不推送。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与相邻环节的接缝\">与相邻环节的接缝</h2><p>状态归一化的事件模型本身属于更广的订单追踪范畴，其跨承运商的标准与事件schema见 <a href=\"../../order-tracking-experience/\">076 国际订单追踪体验与主动通知</a>；本篇只处理其中与清关相关的阶段与 DDP 特有的可见性规则。差异检出若能在清关阶段完成，可以显著降低处置成本，这一点在 <a href=\"../duty-variance-reconcile/over-under-collection-refund\">多收退还与少收补收</a> 中已经论证。而状态可见性规则本身是交货模式决策的下游——见 <a href=\"../ddp-ddu-mode/ddp-vs-ddu-choice-conversion\">DDP 与 DDU 的模式选择</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>外部状态码归一化成六个买家可理解阶段，映射按承运商与口岸配置，且必须容忍未知码。</li>\n<li>「税费处理中」在 DDP 下对买家不可见、在 DAP 下必须可见且附金额，这是两模式在状态展示上最本质的区别。</li>\n<li>推送的判断标准是「是否改变买家要做的事或对时间线的预期」；同阶段重复事件、内部处理事件、静默期内的重复通知都不发。</li>\n<li>覆盖静默期的手段是「静默超历史 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>75</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{75}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">75</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 时主动告知进度」，它不提供新事实但提供确定感。</li>\n<li>清关 ETA 是随机变量，给历史分位区间与参照系措辞，而不是精确到日的承诺。</li>\n<li>事件处理遵循按业务时间排序、幂等去重、阶段不回退三条规则。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>清关阶段也是差异检出最理想的窗口，其经济性论证见 <a href=\"../duty-variance-reconcile/over-under-collection-refund\">多收退还与少收补收</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"清关状态与买家主动沟通","id":"清关状态与买家主动沟通"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"清关状态的归一化","id":"清关状态的归一化"},{"level":3,"text":"六个买家可理解的阶段","id":"六个买家可理解的阶段"},{"level":3,"text":"映射表要可配置","id":"映射表要可配置"},{"level":2,"text":"什么时候该主动推送","id":"什么时候该主动推送"},{"level":3,"text":"应当推送的四个时点","id":"应当推送的四个时点"},{"level":3,"text":"不应当推送的情况","id":"不应当推送的情况"},{"level":2,"text":"预计到达时间的表达","id":"预计到达时间的表达"},{"level":3,"text":"用区间与口径替代点估计","id":"用区间与口径替代点估计"},{"level":3,"text":"措辞比数字更重要","id":"措辞比数字更重要"},{"level":2,"text":"数据质量的自我保护","id":"数据质量的自我保护"},{"level":3,"text":"三条处理规则","id":"三条处理规则"},{"level":2,"text":"与相邻环节的接缝","id":"与相邻环节的接缝"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"低报申报价合规与查验风险","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/landed-cost-ddp-buyer-experience/duty-variance-reconcile/undervalue-compliance-risk"},"next":{"title":"DDP 定价、毛利与税费成本建模","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/landed-cost-ddp-buyer-experience/ddp-experience-ops/ddp-margin-cost-model"}}